# Formerly pinned 0 1 0, seen 1 by the rule R89, opening is an attempt (the author 2026-11-18): the one field of
# S would take the formal a the whole took, so nothing was opened. TZ 2026-11-19 §9.3 withdraws it: W -- S whole
# to `@: a` -- and E -- the one unnamed field, the group (int: p 1; int: q 2), to `@: a` by position -- both fit
# the one declaration: ambiguity 3 (§9.8, the row «W и E подходят одному объявлению»); nothing runs, seen 0.
# Red before this pin too. Derived before the run (opus, step 21.5; fable 2026-11-21).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)

sub: main (S((int: p 1; int: q 2)))
    @: shared node[0]
    fn: g (@: a) int
        return: length(a)
    shared\Observed\seen := g(S)
main()
